values
('Caterpillar','20R-5629','Cat Reman Cylinder Pack','Cat Reman cylinder pack; Cat recommends application for 3512/3516. The explicit Compatible Models section lists Marine Engine 3516C and 3512C, plus Wheel Loader 962K.',ARRAY['3512','3516','3512C','3516C']::text[],'Engine Components','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/20R-5629','Cat product page states Recommended Application 3512/3516; explicit Compatible Models lists Marine Engine 3516C/3512C and Wheel Loader 962K. Only 3516C/3512C are stored as compatible engine models.', 'REFERENCE',null,'{}'::jsonb,ARRAY['3516C','3512C']::text[]),
('Caterpillar','108-6630','Cat Fuel Injection Pump','Cat fuel injection pump used in the fuel system; Cat lists 3406C/3406B truck-engine applications, 3406B marine-engine application and 3412 industrial-engine application.',ARRAY['3406C','3406B','3412']::text[],'Fuel System','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/108-6630','Official Cat Compatible Models section lists Truck Engine 3406C/3406B, Marine Engine 3406B and Industrial Engine 3412.', 'REFERENCE',null,'{"length_in":6.1,"height_in":2.6}'::jsonb,ARRAY['3406C','3406B','3412']::text[]),
('Caterpillar','0R-3841','Cat Reman Cylinder Pack','Cat Reman 13.0:1 compression-ratio cylinder pack; Cat lists 3508/3512/3516 generator-set, marine and industrial engine applications.',ARRAY['3508','3512','3516']::text[],'Engine Components','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/0R-3841','Official Cat Compatible Models section lists Gen Set Engine 3512/3516/3508, Marine Engine 3508/3516/3512, Industrial Engine 3512/3516/3508 and Vehicular Engine 3516/3512.', 'REFERENCE',null,'{"weight_lb":43.54,"compression_ratio":"13.0:1"}'::jsonb,ARRAY['3508','3512','3516']::text[]),
('Caterpillar','110-8897','Cat Fuel Injection Pump','Cat fuel injection pump for listed 3406B/3406C generator-set and marine applications, plus 3406C industrial application.',ARRAY['3406B','3406C']::text[],'Fuel System','Cat Parts Store (official)','https://parts.cat.com/en/catcorp/product/110-8897','Official Cat Compatible Models section lists Gen Set Engine 3406C/3406B, Generator Set 3406C, Marine Engine 3406B/3406C and Industrial Engine 3406C; other listed machines are non-engine equipment.', 'REFERENCE',null,'{"length_in":23.58,"height_in":9.28}'::jsonb,ARRAY['3406C','3406B']::text[])
